  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So, fundamental period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br />Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> be the fundamental period of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>(</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>(</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Squaring both sides, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Therefore, the fundamental period of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
    "image": null
